WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.390
Many Buddhists start the day
by making five short promises.

2
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:09.520
Each one begins with the same words:
I undertake the training rule.

3
00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:10.660
Training.

4
00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.730
Not a commandment from a god.

5
00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:15.550
A word you might expect
to hear from a coach.

6
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:20.530
So can you train yourself to be good,
the way an athlete trains for a race?

7
00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:23.400
In this mission, you'll
learn the Five Precepts,

8
00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:26.530
and the positive practice
that pairs with each one.

9
00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:29.880
Then you'll meet six
perfections, the paramitas,

10
00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:32.670
that Mahayana Buddhists work to develop.

11
00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:36.440
Your mission: find out how
Buddhists answer this question.
